Image Core Profile
Before Starting
Check for product marketing context first (.agents/product-marketing.md). Gather this context:

Image Goal: Type, placement, dimensions.

Production Approach: Brand assets available, photorealistic vs illustrative, template vs one-off.

Technical Context: Available API keys, budget, optimization requirements.

Choosing Your Approach
AI Generation: Original images from text prompts (Gemini, Flux, Ideogram).

AI Editing: Modify existing images (Gemini, Flux Flex, Reve).

Design Tools: Templated, brand-consistent work (Canva, Figma).

Screenshot + Overlay: Product UI showcases (Browser frame + code overlay).

Stock Photography: Generic business/lifestyle scenes (Unsplash, Pexels).

