description: "Generate cohesive, project-specific SVG icon sets for websites and applications."
compatibility: claude-code-only
---
SVG Icon Set Blueprint Engine
Strict Template Syntax Standards
SVG

Hard Vector Boundaries
No Hardcoded Hex Values: Always bind paths to stroke="currentColor" or fill="currentColor".

Half-Pixel Grid Rules: Snap vectors strictly to coordinate integers or half units (12, 12.5). Maximum 2 decimal points.

Padding Safeguards: Maintain a padding container boundary of 2 to 22 pixels on a 24px grid layout.

Optical Corrections: Integrate explicit visual point overshoot variables (+0.5px adjustments) for chevrons and geometry metrics to counter visual weight thinning.

Reference Files Catalog
Industry Icon Allocation Guidelines (references/industry-icons.md)
Universal: menu, close, chevron-down, arrow-right, phone, mail, map-pin, clock.

Trades: wrench, hammer, droplet, flame, bolt, pipe, shield-check, alert-circle.

Medical: heart, stethoscope, tooth, eye, bone, paw, pill, first-aid.

